              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ભીંડો (bhī̃ḍo) is a tadbhava. It comes from Sanskrit bhiṇḍā, the vegetable Abelmoschus esculentus, and CDIAL lists the Gujarati bhĩḍo (CDIAL 9492)."
